      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "バトルをうまく進めると、勝利時の報酬にボーナスが発生します。\r\n\r\n■ノーダメージボーナス\r\n　条件：ダメージを一切受けずにバトルに勝利する\r\n　ボーナス：経験値増加\r\n\r\n■オーバーキルボーナス\r\n　条件：エクストラフェイズ中に敵が全滅した後、追撃を加える\r\n　ボーナス：ギル増加\r\n\r\n■ブレイクフィニッシュボーナス\r\n　条件：最後のエネミーをブレイク状態で倒す\r\n　ボーナス：MRP増加",
        "official_en": "Various bonuses may be earned after a well-fought\r\nbattle:\r\n<text style=\"bold\">-No Damage Bonus</>\r\n　Requirement: Win the battle without taking any\r\n   damage.\r\n　Bonus: Increased EXP.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">-Overkill Bonus</>\r\n　Requirement: After defeating all enemies during\r\n　the bonus phase, perform a follow-up attack.\r\n　Bonus: Increased gil.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">-Stagger Finish Bonus</>\r\n　Requirement: Defeat the final enemy while it is\r\n　staggered.\r\n　Bonus: Increased MRP.",
        "real_en": "Earn bonuses to your rewards by fighting well.\r\n\r\n<text style=\"bold\">-No Damage Bonus</>\r\nRequirement: Win without taking any damage.\r\nBonus: Increased EXP.\r\n\r\n<text style=\"bold\">-Overkill Bonus</>\r\nRequirement: After all enemies have been defeated during the Extra Phase, land a follow-up attack.\r\nBonus: Increased gil.\r\n\r\n<text style=\"bold\">-Break Finish Bonus</>\r\nRequirement: Defeat the final enemy while it is Broken.\r\nBonus: Increased MRP."
      },
